title: "Lean 4 formalization of Quantitative Stochastic Homogenization and Large-Scale Regularity"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/nitromannitol/Quantitative-Stochastic-Homogenization"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization, in progress, of the book Quantitative Stochastic
  Homogenization and Large-Scale Regularity by Armstrong, Kuusi and Mourrat: one module per section
  of the book, and a roadmap listing every numbered result with its status.
